<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves ease to $3.1bln-May 28.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves ease to $3.1bln-May 28.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday its hard currency reserves totalled $3.076 billion as of May 28, down from $3.452 billion on May 21.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES    May 28	May 21     Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	3.076	 3.452	3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	   2.028	 1.903	2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector    5.104	 5.355	5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
